  "stem": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861833-114651791852237200-aysItDl0_2JwOHYAEeoveFBfQwDzMJ-WfVvb16lnhvdGp3Zn5LzxXs3lkAkUJkx0\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一质量为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/5dee915e2fb7b8a1f4328473f9c18ba7.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的滑块在倾角</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/9d7b9d9bf0d5fc25c99170ab27fa4045.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的足够长的固定斜面上、在无外力</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a0ed1ec316bc54c37c4286c208f55667.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的情况下以加速度</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0f9094b8f3c3e90ef4d5841789a55250.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">匀加速下滑。若用一水平向右的恒力</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a0ed1ec316bc54c37c4286c208f55667.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">作用于滑块，如图所示，使滑块由静止开始沿斜面向上做匀加速运动，在</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/84dff10a91efa37897499da381b859ff.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时间内沿斜面运动的位移</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0357a5542cf2c606fbbb3eb801066a1f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/276509f01529d982ab21e479a4619268.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">取</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b1eebd522c4de12f8255e649d3145d51.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）。求：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  height=\"78\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/8/5/36e10d85-f4c1-43fe-aaca-cc7c2afcfe61.png\" width=\"136\" /></p><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861833-114651791852237200-aysItDl0_2JwOHYAEeoveFBfQwDzMJ-WfVvb16lnhvdGp3Zn5LzxXs3lkAkUJkx0\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（1）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">滑块和斜面之间的动摩擦因数</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/1100379a4385b9ce064847bc21760adc.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></p></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861833-114651791852237200-aysItDl0_2JwOHYAEeoveFBfQwDzMJ-WfVvb16lnhvdGp3Zn5LzxXs3lkAkUJkx0\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（2）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">滑块沿斜面向上做匀加速运动的加速度大小是多少；</span></p></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861833-114651791852237200-aysItDl0_2JwOHYAEeoveFBfQwDzMJ-WfVvb16lnhvdGp3Zn5LzxXs3lkAkUJkx0\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（3）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">恒力</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a0ed1ec316bc54c37c4286c208f55667.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的大小。</span></p></div></div></div>",
  "answer": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-answer\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861833-114651791852237200-aysItDl0_2JwOHYAEeoveFBfQwDzMJ-WfVvb16lnhvdGp3Zn5LzxXs3lkAkUJkx0\">（1）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/aa7dc93acbf02b68a6dccb3060756f8d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（2）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/d3b701e408af7b847fa80717da957eb4.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（3）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3589fdc98cf44bc05ab2c07896a93703.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>",
